#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:5
#: 05d45fe7a3954bb184736e9e34de1737 90285255d2e047238525a5602f4bae28
#: abfd73fcd99f42b79306a18e8bf745b3 bf16c4c72ecd498d9e26be501be2ae01
#: edc7c7e899a84efd9a383711c330997d
msgid "Nanoradar MR72"
msgstr "Nanoradar MR72"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:8
#: 005680c4bd214d7795e4c4b792528105 0d42b2769982488d9e58397e1923900a
#: 511e30a18572462aa92283a04683b3ae 66063ec72eb1417b98c41346d17ca4ea
#: 9ff48ad697904d6bbd2920fc8aaea974
msgid ""
"Support for this sensor is available in firmware versions 4.5 and later. "
"Plane does not support this sensor since its a Proximity sensor."
msgstr "固件 4.5 及更高版本支持此传感器。Plane 不支持该传感器，因为它是近距传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:10
#: 5e1999ef05c84a939dd500c1ee52779b 663b51a0026d4b9c8ae38e7f2d990a66
#: 6cd781b11abe4f9ba94e224d0f0f03b9 b8daa2cc6c484da58e9e3127c65997bf
#: fcf8e3dd07dd41e5b163de53ee883244
msgid ""
"The `MR72 <http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/488.html>`__ is 77Ghz-"
"band radar commonly used for object avoidance/detection. Currently only "
"connection via CAN is supported. Serial versions of this Radar isn't "
"officially supported."
msgstr ""
"`MR72 <http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/488.html>`__ 是 77GHz "
"频段雷达，常用于避障/目标探测。目前仅支持 CAN 连接。串口版本的该雷达未获官方支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:17
#: 052125f88f104489898701ef9d8fda63 19a32911c8594ebaa611ff90a89ca0b0
#: 224d5549f879415e9b5fa0b7c6a67360 295d8ab914d54c7ea61e3e3461be347b
#: 8e4969b1f07f417ba147818fdb989248
msgid "Connecting via CAN"
msgstr "通过 CAN 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:19
#: 0dbbc73223b04cb5a46a27283e377e3c 3bbf95f7d56642efbf3d37929a335937
#: 623a8743a1e540d1acfcd35172d83768 a31ea8c3c09f4c1ab619899baab0ac82
#: bb81c4a177f445638a5bf3ee15e4173d
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NSM Software. In particular set the \"ID\" to a"
" unique number if planning to use multiple MR72 on a single CAN bus. You can"
" also set the bitrate from the software."
msgstr "通过 NSM 软件配置传感器。若计划在同一 CAN 总线上使用多个 MR72，请将「ID」设置为唯一编号。也可通过软件设置波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:22
#: 716c6c67c3c8412aa27035a993f18e64 7b1007904920426d95f4bcfbc4d729e5
#: c18ca4685dd94acb9b91eb8033441e04 ce71d9b2cd2741838d5ae1c84a5f29ed
#: dc3ecc86590e449b98d0d368a744142e
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support  same CAN rangefinders connected to "
"different CAN ports. If you would like yo use multiple CAN rangefinders "
"together, connect them to the same bus."
msgstr "ArduPilot 目前不支持将同类 CAN 测距仪连接至不同 CAN 接口。若需同时使用多个 CAN 测距仪，请将它们连接至同一总线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:26
#: 18fe09c40e0d4b2a90ab174692882228 aa520de0b6584d308749633ac5dbb909
#: caf931269d874cc3a6ff6e57d49c55e7 cc765ca51ce0451a937a088d03f484cc
#: d4fe2aae88f04aee81c618d04ac13fc9
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:27
#: 7b65255546ce450b8fa320636be971fe 937c5f7c9c994b5eb5a40ec4a8f141df
#: 9e9f6465df3548dfb469aeeee335f902 d5e0c9a4f101487ca3eed6149a7d2a45
#: e56084ef6be44d48bfddaeb4f78c9f79
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NSM toolprovided by the manufacturer. More "
"details can be found `here "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/File/download/id/466.html>`__. Set the \"ID\" to a "
"unique number if planning to use multiple MR72 on a single CAN bus. You can "
"also set the bitrate from the software to match the CAN bus bitrate (500000 "
"is recommended)."
msgstr ""
"通过制造商提供的 NSM 工具配置传感器，详情可在 `此处 "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/File/download/id/466.html>`__ 获取。若计划在同一 CAN 总线上使用多个 "
"MR72，请将「ID」设置为唯一编号。也可通过软件设置波特率以匹配 CAN 总线波特率（推荐 500000）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:29
#: 36ffe3d54481478ea5ff609f94d7682a 496579f2a84b4a64b12ae076e4157789
#: 6d13309782ec4fff8adbe47019bb6d1d fb7d5ced33c04f8bad99407494fdcd86
#: fd427908dc2348a8bed2df82e8e38556
msgid ""
"For autopilot connection you can use any spare CAN port. Since this is not a"
" DroneCAN based sensor, you will not be able to use the connected port with "
"any other sensor. The diagram below shows how to connect to CAN2."
msgstr ""
"连接飞控时可使用任意空闲 CAN 接口。由于该传感器不基于 DroneCAN，所连接的接口将无法与其他传感器共用。下图展示了连接至 CAN2 的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:34
#: 128192182f094071a29f7cb5cacb4551 28e6d87fc8e3487b834080d1e59f9ff8
#: 912c33bde32f4b05ae96b41757e5d9f6 ca4f2fc8ee164920bf242611f1bf407a
#: e77f40a5d0e647daa65d942de84f4c4e
msgid "Set the following parameters"
msgstr "设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:36
#: 19ef1179c5f24fbebc2633afe6adbb60 383239c9c44e48ddbe02afff5412bea5
#: 575bed15b39342379e57ede2d5b76e18 cc0837220ed44fabb78e37a029171740
#: edecc79df9f14e438f3d894c40af000d
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER <CAN_P2_DRIVER>` = 2 (to enable the 2nd CAN port using "
"the second CAN driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER <CAN_P2_DRIVER>` = 2（启用第二个 CAN 接口，使用第二 CAN 驱动器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:37
#: 10341fba0b304237bbe0629d9a285874 1f1210f76aaf4846a1bcb490f4af8ebc
#: a0bb8598d02040208325b4caa8e8d428 c9504d60c9ed4216aee26cec028474bb
#: e8402d8979aa4b4e8feea5bc75fbc384
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE<CAN_P2_BITRATE>` = 500000 (Or as set in NAssistant)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE<CAN_P2_BITRATE>` = 500000（或与 NAssistant 中设置一致）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:38
#: 42cfa602b71548e59d6791584223ae61
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL<CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (NanoRadar)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL<CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 14（NanoRadar）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:39
#: ff3a60d4eb6d4ca1b3f6ebbd2c69312a
msgid ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 17 (MR72_CAN) Reboot afer setting this."
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 17（MR72_CAN），设置后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:40
#: 03c8fa5475924ce799b6a9b6b10c9325 2c7e54bd101f4652911e9919ecab8b15
#: 369c5921bbeb4766a95d2db9aaf49ef0 414be9de9e674305a34175eb4fe6661f
#: 96c557d10a064835a2bdf9c6fda05972
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = \"0\" if mounted on the top of the "
"vehicle, \"1\" if mounted upside-down on the bottom of the vehicle."
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = 「0」，如果安装在飞行器顶部；「1」，如果倒置安装在飞行器底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:41
#: 225109f0b73d41ea9f4d3f277e78bb62 28f9d5e52da4467db8cf8898ff4657bb
#: 4fecc72b6c6443aa8dd0fddeeb1944f8 51f44a9bf8e042ddbd8d113588e54ba9
#: f44853c3794b4c23b62fca8433af2897
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_YAW_CORR <PRX1_YAW_CORR>` allows adjusting the forward direction "
"of the unit.  One way to determine this angle is to use the Mission "
"Planner's Setup >> Advanced, Proximity viewer and then walk around the "
"vehicle and ensure that the sector distances shorten appropriately."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PRX1_YAW_CORR <PRX1_YAW_CORR>` 用于调整设备前向方向。确定该角度的一种方法是使用 Mission "
"Planner 的「设置 >> 高级，近距查看器」，然后绕飞行器行走，确认各扇区距离随之正确缩短。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:42
#: 804cb68c3c4b4a36ab783d54fe59badf 9c749cfe6e64476e93241422003d2162
#: a820fc65f59a40e48402e56ea03ca352 d1f198f3a57c46a88049d9feb928438c
#: f8f330598ac4426d81a5d025609b3a54
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` and :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 "
"<PRX1_IGN_WID1>` should be left at default."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` 和 :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 <PRX1_IGN_WID1>` "
"保持默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:44
#: 6124b0f46db4463097ea8f49bb1277f9 6b1dc29c2d46460caa08277438088200
#: 8a06571c8c73475287e7990288ff3435 a502591e7f9a499abbebaf155548f353
#: e1755faf7dcf4f3a8f2dbe1a80ce3b3d
msgid ""
"More details on using this sensor for object avoidance on Copter can be "
"found :ref:`here <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"有关在 Copter 上使用此传感器进行避障的更多详情，请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:49
#: 67124a78249a432ba456ae2318191714 94d8a4c5c3de4e0e9f66bd543c9dfd1a
#: 9acf149570504b58a23640d28cddc845 c40b7317f61f47d9b3eacd92b8ba639b
#: cbcfcd1956a34a01a521182db96e92c1
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:51
#: 09163b8ed0504eaab744c072034f0348 26db1ba7026b4c08bc2c204bd87cb89e
#: 491503ed1aa94e42accdaf7341fa238d 71bfd69e210444f59e2788719234cb0b
#: b59b21e89e674226afe8cfaaa2edaa66
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:38
#: 7b8369abe3be4d6f86fc3fb3e8763c53 8cb9308884314c37b7fcce2745945ea8
#: a933fe2cda5d4565ac0de206ac817075 dc8e14b71b0149cc846a16982f08ab43
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL<CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (RadarCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL<CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (RadarCAN)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-mr72.rst:39
#: 08848c5d0ad14857a1b7c3e3f86e21bc 17ab97961726436bb8758769b393dd02
#: 519d3f49704b4567ac3c30d397464773 976ab4e196944cafa6db20563155e9e7
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 17 (MR72_CAN) Reboot after setting this."
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 17 (MR72_CAN)，设置后需重启。"
